{"channelId":"UC178xtlLbMM1LV9-JW2xswg","row":["Ching Farm Animal Sanctuary",24,"Farm animals have the same emotional capacity as traditional companions like dogs and cats, yet modern cruelty laws do not apply to them. Under the law, they are seen as mere objects for human use.\n\nAt Ching Farm, we fill a need in the Salt Lake area by advocating for farm animals through rescue, education, and adoption/placement services. We believe that our advocate work can help change perceptions of farm animals and create a deeper respect for the rich emotional lives of these animals.\n\nChing Farm Rescue and Sanctuary was founded by Faith and Mike Ching in Utah in 1998. The farm became incorporated as Ching Farm Rescue as a 501(c)(3) non-profit organization, and your donations are tax-deductible.","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC178xtlLbMM1LV9-JW2xswg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC178xtlLbMM1LV9-JW2xswg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:11:39.214Z","channelId":"UC178xtlLbMM1LV9-JW2xswg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"84919c3427b91ec6bb9a14e2ece8c383d89095e62449efdcc401e92dd34c2673","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"827b21264b32a47b5a67d193e5d64ee830c524ed4f258205348e15ba4f4ac152"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC178xtlLbMM1LV9-JW2xswg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":24,"raw":"24 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC178xtlLbMM1LV9-JW2xswg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:11:39.214Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"name_only","role":"undetermined","flags":[],"sourceUrls":[]}],"cleanup":{"status":"review","code":"biography_audience_review","reason":"简介上下文未证明本人与目标人群的关系；保留原记录，不猜测身份。","keywords":[],"role":"organization_self_report","excerpt":"re seen a